{
    "name":  "dsh-chat-image-lightbox",
    "description":  "对话里的图值得被认真看：点一下全屏灯箱（缩放/拖拽平移/下载另存/左右翻页），一键把会话内的图收成可调列数的缩略图网格，或整块隐藏（不留空白）；本地图 TIFF/HEIC 自动无损转码，网图被防盗链拦截时自动转存本地显示。| Chat images get a proper look: full-screen lightbox (zoom / drag pan / download / prev-next), a conversation-wide thumbnail grid with adjustable columns, hide/show without leaving blank space, lossless TIFF/HEIC transcoding, and automatic local fallback for hotlink-protected images.",
    "version":  "1.7.4",
    "type":  "module",
    "main":  "lib/index.js",
    "exports":  {
                    ".":  "./lib/index.js",
                    "./client":  "./lib/client.js",
                    "./package.json":  "./package.json"
                },
    "files":  [
                  "lib/**/*.js",
                  "cordis.patch.yml",
                  "README.md",
                  "LICENSE",
                  "docs/images/lightbox.png",
                  "docs/images/columns-3col.png",
                  "docs/images/columns-multi.png",
                  "docs/images/hide-images.png"
              ],
    "license":  "MIT",
    "engines":  {
                    "node":  "\u003e=18",
                    "dsh":  "\u003e=0.1.7-rc.1"
                },
    "dsh":  {
                "bundle":  {
                               "patch":  "./cordis.patch.yml"
                           },
                "client":  {
                               "inject":  [
                                              "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
                                              "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
                                              "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-tool"
                                          ],
                               "platform":  "web"
                           }
            },
    "keywords":  [
                     "dsh-plugin",
                     "deepseek-harness",
                     "image",
                     "lightbox",
                     "gallery",
                     "thumbnail",
                     "tiff",
                     "download"
                 ],
    "repository":  {
                       "type":  "git",
                       "url":  "git+https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-chat-image-lightbox.git"
                   },
    "bugs":  {
                 "url":  "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-chat-image-lightbox/issues"
             },
    "homepage":  "https://github.com/loyalchiiina/dsh-chat-image-lightbox#readme",
    "dependencies":  {
                         "sharp":  "0.34.4"
                     },
    "peerDependencies":  {
                             "@deepseek-ai/cordis":  "^4.0.2",
                             "@deepseek-ai/dsh":  "\u003e=0.1.7-rc.1"
                         },
    "devDependencies":  {
                            "@deepseek-ai/cordis":  "^4.0.2",
                            "@deepseek-ai/dsh":  "\u003e=0.1.7-rc.1"
                        }
}